        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Complex.ofReal_pow#doc\">docs#Complex.ofReal_pow</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Complex.ofReal_im#doc\">docs#Complex.ofReal_im</a></p>",
